---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import LineIcon from '../LineIcon.astro';
import art from '../../assets/headers/beneficios-consultorio-grabado.png';
---

<section class="ps-section home-pharmacy" aria-labelledby="home-pharmacy-title">
  <div class="ps-wrap pharmacy-layout">
    <header>
      <p class="ps-kicker">Beneficios para la vida cotidiana</p>
      <h2 id="home-pharmacy-title">
        Farmacia
        <br />
        <em>Social.</em>
      </h2>
      <p class="pharmacy-location">
        <LineIcon name="pin" size={21} /> Paraná, Entre Ríos
      </p>
    </header>
    <div class="pharmacy-information">
      <p>Consultá los horarios de atención y qué necesitás para acceder a la Farmacia Social.</p>
      <div class="pharmacy-orders">
        <h3>Órdenes de compra</h3>
        <p>Preguntá qué comercios participan y cuáles son las condiciones de uso.</p>
      </div>
      <a href="/beneficios/#farmacia">
        Ver farmacia y beneficios <LineIcon name="arrow" size={22} />
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="pharmacy-art" aria-hidden="true">
    <Image
      src={art}
      alt=""
      format="webp"
      width={960}
      widths={[480, 960]}
      sizes="(max-width: 650px) 100vw, 65vw"
      loading="lazy"
    />
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  :global(.portal-system) .home-pharmacy {
    position: relative;
    isolation: isolate;
    background: #9c2832;
    color: #fffaf1;
    overflow: hidden;
    --ps-heading-ink: #f6d5af;
  }
  .pharmacy-layout {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: clamp(2rem, 7vw, 6rem);
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    align-items: center;
  }
  :global(.portal-system) .home-pharmacy h2 {
    font-size: clamp(3.8rem, 7vw, 7rem);
    line-height: 0.95;
  }
  :global(.portal-system) .home-pharmacy h2 em {
    color: #f6dfb8;
  }
  :global(.portal-system) .home-pharmacy h2::after {
    display: none;
  }
  .pharmacy-location {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    margin-block: 1.3rem 0;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .pharmacy-art {
    position: absolute;
    z-index: 0;
    width: 68%;
    left: -9%;
    bottom: -20%;
    height: 85%;
    opacity: 0.13;
    mix-blend-mode: screen;
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .pharmacy-art img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }
  .pharmacy-information {
    padding-inline-start: 2rem;
    border-inline-start: 1px solid #f4d4b585;
  }
  .pharmacy-information > p {
    font-size: clamp(1.2rem, 1.8vw, 1.5rem);
    line-height: 1.5;
    max-width: 32ch;
  }
  .pharmacy-orders {
    padding-block-start: 1.1rem;
    border-block-start: 1px solid #f4d4b585;
  }
  :global(.portal-system) .home-pharmacy h3 {
    font: 700 1.25rem / 1.4 var(--sans);
    letter-spacing: normal;
  }
  .pharmacy-orders p {
    margin-block: 0.5rem 1.5rem;
    max-width: 40ch;
  }
  .pharmacy-information a {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1rem;
    min-height: 52px;
    padding: 0.8rem 1.1rem;
    border-radius: 5px;
    background: #fffaf1;
    color: var(--navy);
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  .pharmacy-information a:hover {
    background: #f6dfb8;
  }
  .pharmacy-information :global(svg) {
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .home-pharmacy a:focus-visible {
    outline-color: #fffaf1;
  }
  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .pharmacy-layout {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    }
    .pharmacy-information {
      border-inline-start: 0;
      border-block-start: 1px solid #f4d4b585;
      padding: 1.5rem 0 0;
    }
    .pharmacy-art {
      width: 130%;
      bottom: 0;
      height: 50%;
    }
  }
</style>
